e Plank.png\" data-image-name=\"Electrified Tree Plank.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">$5/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$91/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$113.75/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.34.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 4th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nThe <b>Electrified Tree</b> is an uncommon rarity tree in Oaklands. This tree can spawn anywhere on the surface during a thunderstorm. It does not replace normal trees naturally. However, <a href=\"/wiki/Michael%27s_Copper_Axe\" title=\"Michael&#39;s Copper Axe\">Michael’s Copper Axe</a> can be used to attract lightning near a tree (during a thunderstorm) to create an electrified tree. It is one of three tree types that can spawn from an <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor\" title=\"Meteor\">Electrified Meteor.</a>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>According to the developer, Electrified Trees and their counterparts have no specific equation to follow when spawning - it is a percent chance for one to spawn on the surface during a Thunderstorm.\n</p><p>Electrified Trees can spawn along side <a href=\"/wiki/Eel_Kelp\" title=\"Eel Kelp\">Eel Kelp</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Bamboo\" title=\"Electrified Bamboo\">Electrified Bamboo</a> at an Electrified Meteor crash site.\n</p><p>Electrified Trees have roughly the same toughness as a <a href=\"/wiki/Birch\" title=\"Birch\">Birch</a> tree.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"ea2dd35f4168a05aaf987c33aceeecb0\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:126px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Electrifiedsandednew-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:106px; width:185px; top:9px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Electrifiedsandednew.png\" title=\"Electrifiedsandednew.png (94 KB)\" style=\"height:106px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4e/Electrifiedsandednew.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230804205255\" title=\"Electrifiedsandednew.png (94 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sanded (Unused)\" height=\"124\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Electrifiedsandednew.png\" data-image-key=\"Electrifiedsandednew.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded (Unused)\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Electrifiedsandednew.png (94 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sanded (Unused)\" height=\"124\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Electrifiedsandednew.png\" data-image-key=\"Electrifiedsandednew.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded (Unused)\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4e/Electrifiedsandednew.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230804205255\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Sanded (Unused)</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:126px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Electrifiedlog-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:124px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Electrifiedlog.png\" title=\"Electrifiedlog.png (53 KB)\" style=\"height:124px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2d/Electrifiedlog.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230804202217\" title=\"Electrifiedlog.png (53 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sanded (Unused old)\" height=\"124\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Electrifiedlog.png\" data-image-key=\"Electrifiedlog.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded (Unused old)\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Electrifiedlog.png (53 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sanded (Unused old)\" height=\"124\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Electrifiedlog.png\" data-image-key=\"Electrifiedlog.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded (Unused old)\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2d/Electrifiedlog.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230804202217\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Sanded (Unused old)</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:126px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Electrified_Kelp-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:84px; width:185px; top:20px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Electrified_Kelp.png\" title=\"Electrified Kelp.png (3.07 MB)\" style=\"height:84px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/50/Electrified_Kelp.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240525080244\" title=\"Electrified Kelp.png (3.07 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Glitched Electrified Tree spawn\" height=\"124\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Electrified Kelp.png\" data-image-key=\"Electrified_Kelp.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Glitched Electrified Tree spawn\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Electrified Kelp.png (3.07 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Glitched Electrified Tree spawn\" height=\"124\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Electrified Kelp.png\" data-image-key=\"Electrified_Kelp.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Glitched Electrified Tree spawn\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/50/Electrified_Kelp.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240525080244\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Glitched Electrified Tree spawn</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Patch v1.34.1 changed the color from greenish-blue to light blue.</li>\n<li>Electrified Tree has an alternative unused teal blue wood texture instead of the neon texture.</li>\n<li>When sanded or planked, Electrified Tree is the fourth-most valuable tree in the game, only coming short of <a href=\"/wiki/Plek\" title=\"Plek\">Plek</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\">Magma Trees</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a>.</li>\n<li>The electricity particle decal is <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://create.roblox.com/store/asset/3442350641/electric\">this</a> and/or <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://create.roblox.com/store/asset/3442503630/electric-2\">this</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" tit